### 说明
# 先跑 auth.http 里的「登录」，token 会自动写入全局变量 {{token}}
# 管理员账号 admin 才能调用 /api/admin/** 接口

### 1. 创建题目（管理员）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/problems
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "A+B Problem",
  "content": "# 题目描述\n输入两个整数，输出它们的和。\n\n## 输入格式\n一行两个整数 a b，用空格分隔。\n\n## 输出格式\n一个整数，表示 a + b 的结果。",
  "difficulty": 1,
  "timeLimit": 1000,
  "memoryLimit": 256,
  "cases": [
    { "input": "1 2", "output": "3", "isSample": 1, "score": 0 },
    { "input": "10 20", "output": "30", "isSample": 1, "score": 0 },
    { "input": "SECRET_INPUT_999", "output": "SECRET_OUTPUT_999", "isSample": 0, "score": 100 }
  ]
}

### 2. 题目列表（不返回题面，注意响应里没有 content 字段）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/problems?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. 题目列表 - 按难度筛选（1-简单 2-中等 3-困难）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/problems?page=1&size=10&difficulty=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 题目列表 - 关键字搜索 + 按提交数排序
GET http://localhost:8080/api/problems?page=1&size=10&keyword=A%2BB&sortBy=submitCount&asc=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 题目详情（只返回示例用例，看不到 SECRET_INPUT_999）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/problems/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 管理端详情（能看到全部 3 个用例，含隐藏用例）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/problems/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. 更新题目（用例全量替换：旧的会被删掉）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/problems/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "A+B Problem（加强版）",
  "content": "# 新题面\n输入两个大整数。",
  "difficulty": 2,
  "timeLimit": 2000,
  "memoryLimit": 512,
  "cases": [
    { "input": "5 5", "output": "10", "isSample": 1, "score": 0 },
    { "input": "NEW_SECRET", "output": "NEW_SECRET_OUT", "isSample": 0, "score": 100 }
  ]
}

### 8. 删除题目（逻辑删除，删完再查详情会返回 2001）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/admin/problems/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. 参数校验：难度越界（应返回 400）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/problems
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "测试",
  "content": "x",
  "difficulty": 9,
  "cases": [{ "input": "a", "output": "b", "isSample": 1 }]
}

### 10. 参数校验：没有测试用例（应返回 400）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/problems
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "测试",
  "content": "x",
  "difficulty": 1,
  "cases": []
}

### 11. 不存在的题目（应返回 2001）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/problems/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. 普通用户访问管理端接口（应返回 403）
# 先用 testuser / 123456 登录，把它的 token 粘到下面
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/problems
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
  "title": "x",
  "content": "x",
  "difficulty": 1,
  "cases": [{ "input": "a", "output": "b", "isSample": 1 }]
}
